# Arogya Vana

> Arogya Vana is a managed farmland project by Saptha Ventures near Bagepalli, about 2 hours from Bengaluru. Arogya Vana currently sells farmland plots only, to farmland buyers. Phase 2 plots are 4,400 sq ft at ₹299 per sq ft. Phase 1 is sold out. No Phase 3 price has been announced. The land is planted with white sandalwood, casuarina and seasonal fruits and vegetables.

Key facts:

- Brand: Arogya Vana ("An Arogya Vana project by Saptha Ventures")
- Developer: Saptha Ventures
- What is sold: farmland plots, land only
- Plot size and rate: Phase 2 plots are 4,400 sq ft at ₹299 per sq ft. Registration and stamp duty are extra as per government rates. No other rate is published.
- Phases: Phase 1 is sold out. Phase 2 is the current offer. No Phase 3 price has been announced.
- Farm: near Bagepalli, about 2 hours from Bengaluru
- Sales office (not the farm): First Floor, 36, NTI Layout 1st phase, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560092. Open Wednesday to Monday, 9 am to 6 pm; closed Tuesday
- Contact: call +91 70909 05031; info@arogyavana.com

## Clarifications

- Arogya Vana currently sells farmland plots only. Buyers are farmland buyers.
- The only published rate is Phase 2: 4,400 sq ft at ₹299 per sq ft. Phase 1 is sold out. No Phase 3 price has been announced.
- Crops named by Arogya Vana: white sandalwood, casuarina, seasonal fruits and vegetables. Mahogany is not named.
- Arogya Vana publishes no ratings or reviews on its own site.

